mctrace 1
profile 1
precision f32
tick 1 time 41800000 dt 00000000
tile 0 site 0 args 0 result number 42280000
tile 1 site 1 args 0 result number 40e00000
tile 2 site 2 args 0 result number 40e00000
port gpio digital-write 2 7
port gpio digital-write 3 7
tile 3 site 3 args 1 number 40e00000 result nil
tick 2 time 42000000 dt 41800000
tile 0 site 0 args 0 result number 42280000
tile 1 site 1 args 0 result number 40e00000
tile 2 site 2 args 0 result number 40e00000
port gpio digital-write 2 7
port gpio digital-write 3 7
tile 3 site 3 args 1 number 40e00000 result nil
